/...","line":13},{"title":"**PowerBI-Ontology-Extractor**","target":"https://github.com/cloudbadal007/powerbi-ontology-extractor","line":19},{"title":"last article","target":"https://medium.com/@cloudpankaj/the-power-bi-ontology-paradox-how-20-million-dashboards-became-microsofts-secret-weapon-for-5585e7d18c01?sk=da8d087fa30162205bb2941d377272f5","line":29},{"title":"Remember the $4.6M logistics disaster?","target":"https://medium.com/@cloudpankaj/the-4-6m-question-why-your-ai-agent-needs-a-security-guard-not-just-a-database-connection-ba28dbfb5d05?sk=2e4d6ac7c90880d03b433531cf68a484","line":592},{"title":"The tool also exports to OntoGuard format (my other project)","target":"https://medium.com/@cloudpankaj/ontoguard-i-built-an-ontology-firewall-for-ai-agents-in-48-hours-using-cursor-ai-be4208c405e7?sk=606adf8c7a704bf6328bcaef9fec53a0","line":713},{"title":"Getting Started Guide","target":"https://github.com/cloudbadal007/powerbi-ontology-extractor/docs/getting_started.md","line":1043},{"title":"API Reference","target":"https://github.com/cloudbadal007/powerbi-ontology-extractor/docs/api_reference.md","line":1044},{"title":"Examples","target":"https://github.com/cloudbadal007/powerbi-ontology-extractor/examples/","line":1045},{"title":"**PowerBI-Ontology-Extractor**","target":"https://github.com/cloudbadal007/powerbi-ontology-extractor","line":1075},{"title":"**OntoGuard**","target":"https://github.com/cloudbadal007/ontoguard-ai","line":1076},{"title":"**Universal Agent Connector**","target":"https://github.com/cloudbadal007/universal-agent-connector","line":1077},{"title":"The Power BI Ontology Paradox","target":"https://medium.com/@cloudpankaj/the-power-bi-ontology-paradox-how-20-million-dashboards-became-microsofts-secret-weapon-for-5585e7d18c01?sk=da8d087fa30162205bb2941d377272f5","line":1089},{"title":"github.com/cloudbadal007/powerbi-ontology-extractor","target":"https://github.com/cloudbadal007/powerbi-ontology-extractor","line":1125},{"title":"Getting Start